# Fun Arcade

A mobile-friendly mini game app with multiple arcade games in one place.

## Games included
- Memory Match
- Tic-Tac-Toe
- Reaction Rush
- Number Guess
- Rock Paper Scissors
- Simon Says

## Run locally
Open the project folder and serve it with a simple local server:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then visit:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

## Mobile-friendly / installable web app
This project also includes a web app manifest and service worker, so it can be installed on supported mobile browsers as a home-screen app.

## APK note
A true Android APK needs Android Studio / Capacitor or Expo packaging. This repo is set up as a mobile-friendly web app first, which is the fastest path to installability on mobile devices. If you want, the next step can be turning this into a Capacitor-based Android app.
